---------------------------------------------------------------------
                           Known Bugs:
---------------------------------------------------------------------
	May turn BBS screen to the color of workbench but this
may be dependent on memory addresses I think as I have a few that
do this (ones I didn't write) this can be cured when it happens
by clicking the screen to the back then and bringing it to the
front again, this is not realy a bug and may be somthing to do
with the compiler or librarys if you know what causes this
please let me know and I will try to fix it.
It has no other bugs that I know of.

---------------------------------------------------------------------
                             History:
---------------------------------------------------------------------
    V3.0 Fixed the bug that caused some machines to lockup if
	 someone entered a number outside the two digit month
         setting users can't enter a number higher than 12 or
         lower than 01 or a single number now in the month field
    V2.0 Removed the need for the year file so you can dump it
         if you want as it's no longer used.
    V1.9 Split the date of birth question into 3 parts to make
         it easer for users to enter the date corectly, also
         made it so they can't skip any part of it (still keep
         an eye on the files though).
    V1.8 Added External Year File So That The SysOp Didn't
         Have To Edit All The Dates Entered By The Users To
         Match Current Year.
    V1.7 Added External Ansi So SysOps Could Use Their Own
         Ansi Screen For Happy BirthDay Message.
    V1.6 Added To The Question So The User Could Understand
         What They Had To Put Into The Answer Slot.
    V1.5 Bugs Fixed Got Confused Sometimes About Data File
         Existence.
    V1.1 [First Public Release] Added Question If Data File
         Couldn't Be Found So It Could Make One, SysOp Still
         Had To Edit The Year.
    V1.0 [BETA] Added Data File Check And If Not There Will Ask
         User To Let The SysOp Know What Their BirthDate
         Was.
    V0.9 [BETA] Base Door All Dates Had To Match Current Year
         And Used Hard Coded Ansi For Happy BirthDay Display.

